<h2 id="ai-work-title">How I work with AI</h2>
<p class="lede">Practical automation, grounded in how your business works.</p>
<p>I help business owners connect systems, reduce repetitive work and turn operational problems into maintainable software. I combine full-stack engineering with AI workflows and verify the result against the people and processes it needs to support.</p>
<div class="service-grid">
<section><h3>Understand the workflow</h3><p>I work with stakeholders to identify the recurring task, the systems involved and what a successful outcome looks like. Healthcare integrations and enterprise delivery inform that approach.</p></section>
<section><h3>Build the harness</h3><p>I organize instructions, reusable skills, tool access and verification steps around an AI coding agent. Claude Code and Codex support API scaffolding, SQL refactoring and test generation, with review before changes are accepted.</p></section>
<section><h3>Connect and automate</h3><p>Meta Chatter explores webhook intake, local Ollama classification and structured routing into Sheets and messaging requests. Existing notification integrations show how I connect APIs to operational workflows.</p></section>
<section><h3>Check the outcome</h3><p>Custom Claude skills, SonarQube code auditing and Playwright/Argus testing help surface defects and validate changes. I review outputs, investigate failures and keep business requirements central to delivery.</p></section>
